  "title": "Strawberry Cream Parfaits with Coconut Macaroons",
  "description": "Orange zest infused cream is layered with coconut macaroons and fresh strawberries to make these irresistible parfaits.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Pam Anderson"
  ],
